tags: utc, coordinated universal time

The time scale UTC: its seconds are the seconds of atomic time, and a leap second keeps
it near the rotation of the Earth. A time of day in a formal (for example 00:00:00) is
in this scale when the formal names this concept.

=== formal
class=concept
day=a day has 86400 seconds; a day that ends with a positive leap second has 86401, a day that ends with a negative leap second has 86399
name=utc
